      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian30-5.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian30-6.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian30-7.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian30-8.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
      <img src="https://www.kiantiong.com/images/kautian30-9.jpg" class="carousel-img" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="carousel-controls">
    <button class="carousel-btn prev">&#8592;</button>
    <div class="carousel-indicator">
      <span class="carousel-current">1</span>/<span class="carousel-total"
        >9</span
      >
    </div>
    <button class="carousel-btn next">&#8594;</button>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function () {
    const container = document.currentScript.previousElementSibling;
    const track = container.querySelector(".carousel-track");
    const images = track.querySelectorAll("img");
    const prevBtn = container.querySelector(".carousel-btn.prev");
    const nextBtn = container.querySelector(".carousel-btn.next");
    const indicator = container.querySelector(".carousel-indicator");
    const current = indicator.querySelector(".carousel-current");
    let idx = 0;
    function update() {
      track.style.transform = `translateX(-${idx * 100}%)`;
      current.textContent = idx + 1;
    }
    prevBtn.onclick = function () {
      idx = (idx - 1 + images.length) % images.length;
      update();
    };
    nextBtn.onclick = function () {
      idx = (idx + 1) % images.length;
      update();
    };

    let startX = null;
    track.addEventListener("touchstart", (e) => {
      startX = e.touches[0].clientX;
    });
    track.addEventListener("touchend", (e) => {
      if (startX === null) return;
      let dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - startX;
      if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) {
        if (dx < 0) nextBtn.onclick();
        else prevBtn.onclick();
      }
      startX = null;
    });
  })();
</script>

<h2 id="教典僻智識主題曲">教典僻智識主題曲</h2>
<p>演唱 by Suno AI<br>

<a href="https://suno.com/song/caf85743-aaa3-47f1-b990-b7900202dd5b" target="_blank" rel="noopener">版本 1 </a> 
<a href="https://suno.com/song/4c5ded9d-e9b9-4b6e-b738-d523c8950f18" target="_blank" rel="noopener">版本 2 </a></p>
<blockquote>
<p>教典僻智識　有阿明的戲劇<br>
Kàu-tián phiah-tì-sik, ū A-bîng ê hì-ki̍k</p>
<p>精彩的戲曲　攏是伊的記憶<br>
tsing-tshái ê hì-khik, lóng sī i ê kì-ik</p>
<p>無欲做桂竹　欲就做刺竹<br>
bô beh tsò kuì-tik, beh tō tsò tshì-tik</p>
<p>故事欲刺激　做人愛有氣魄<br>
kòo-sū beh tshì-kik, tsò-lâng ài ū khì-phik</p>
<p>發揮智力　展出好氣色<br>
huat-hui tì-li̍k, tián tshut hó khì-sik</p>
<p>替你想好對策　聽教典主題曲<br>
thè lí siūnn hó tuì-tshik, thiann Kàu-tián tsú-tê-khik</p></blockquote>
<p><sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup><sup id="fnref:2"><a href="#fn:2" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref">2</a></sup></p>
<div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
<hr>
<ol>
<li id="fn:1">
<p>註：regex 會當用 <code>\S</code> 表示「非空白符號」，寫 <code>\S</code> 取代 <code>[^ ]</code> 語法會當寫閣較短&#160;<a href="#fnref:1" class="footnote-backref" role="doc-backlink">&#x21a9;&#xfe0e;</a></p>
</li>
<li id="fn:2">
<p>註：regex 會當用 <code>\d</code> 表示「數字」，寫 <code>\d</code> 取代 <code>[1-8]</code> 語法會當寫閣較短&#160;<a href="#fnref:2" class="footnote-backref" role="doc-backlink">&#x21a9;&#xfe0e;</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</div>

文章語言：台語





<div class="callout callout-note">

    <div class="callout-content">
        註 1：羅馬字較複雜，後一篇才會詳細講<br>
註 2：上下底有囥貧惰包，無欲了解原理嘛通好 khóo 去用
    </div>
</div> 
<p>2023 教典更新允准人用正規表達式（Regular Expression, regex）搜揣辭典內容，正規表達式是一種會當描寫文字組成規則的語法，通好予咱揣著家己需要的詞的結構，欲揣疊詞抑是一寡主題性的詞目類型攏真方便。這篇圖文解說有提供真濟例，希望會當予逐家對 regex 的應用有閣較濟的想法。</p>
<p>後一篇會來講羅馬字按怎揣，羅馬字的規則會較僫寫。另外 ChhoeTaigi 辭典真早就有正規表達式功能矣，嘛有針對羅馬字設計真濟方便的功能，後一篇可能會做伙介紹喔。</p>
<p>當然，正規表達式嘛通好提來揣一寡奇奇怪怪的物件，然後共寫做教典僻智識，嚴格來講這篇教學應該算是<strong>教典僻智識的僻智識</strong>😜</p>
